  "description": "Effortless Folding for Urban Living\nDesigned for the modern commuter, the BK35S PRO folds down in seconds to a compact 90x75x43 cm. Whether you’re storing it under your office desk, navigating a crowded elevator, or tucking it into a small apartment closet, this 20kg lightweight e-bike fits seamlessly into your lifestyle.\nSmooth, Sweat-Free Commutes\nPower through your morning transit with a high-efficiency 250W brushless motor. Easily conquer city slopes up to 25° and zip through traffic with three adjustable speed levels (up to 25 km/h), ensuring you arrive at your destination refreshed and on time.\nExtended Range with Fast Charging\nSay goodbye to range anxiety. The 36V 9Ah battery delivers a reliable 40–65 km range—perfect for a full day of commuting and errands. With a rapid 4–5 hour charge time, your bike is always powered up and ready to go before your next shift begins.\nSmart App & Precise Control\nStay connected with the integrated Smart App and S869 LCD display. Monitor your speed, battery life, and mileage in real-time. Paired with a Shimano 7-speed transmission, you can shift gears effortlessly to match the rhythm of the city streets.\nDesigned for Comfort & Safety\nYour safety is our priority. Equipped with dual disc brakes for instant stopping power and puncture-resistant tires for a worry-free ride. Featuring an ergonomic seat and adjustable handlebar heights (96-108 cm), it provides a personalized, comfortable fit for every rider.",
